{"step_index":29,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T17:48:42Z","thinking":"Identifying necessary files for prototype construction. The `translations.js` file is essential, containing UI strings, classroom presets, vocabulary, and team member data. Also, styling requirements are documented in `styles.css` outlining color palettes and tribal motif integration.\n\n\nThe user interface should leverage glassmorphism for a modern aesthetic, enhanced by animated script tickers and interactive widgets. The live demo will feature online/offline modes, dropdown language selection for source and target, classroom presets, a microphone with a visual waveform, and a progress bar to show translation stages. The output card will showcase native scripts, pronunciation guides, text-to-speech, educational flashcards, and copy functionality.\n\n\nAnalyzing architectural components and their interactions within the application. The system integrates multiple technologies for translation, including a lightweight model and offline capabilities facilitated by local storage. The main application file manages UI translations, demo control, and animation.\n\nThe `index.html` file provides the structural foundation. The social impact section with animated counters and policy badges will demonstrate project alignment. A video walkthrough and team section will complete the application's presentation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"@'\n// BhashaSetu AI - Language & UI Data\nwindow.UI_STRINGS = {\n  en: {\n    nav_problem: \"Problem\",\n    nav_solution: \"Solution\",\n    nav_demo: \"Live Demo\",\n    nav_how: \"How It Works\",\n    nav_tech: \"Tech Stack\",\n    nav_impact: \"Impact\",\n    nav_video: \"Pitch Video\",\n    nav_team: \"Team\",\n    nav_cta: \"Launch Prototype\",\n\n    hero_badge: \"Government of Jharkhand • SIH 2024 Problem Statement #1628\",\n    hero_title: \"BhashaSetu AI\",\n    hero_title_hi: \"भाषासेतु AI\",\n    hero_tagline: \"\\\"Every Child Learns Best in Their Mother Tongue\\\"\",\n    hero_desc: \"Bridging the tribal-vernacular learning divide in 35,000+ rural Jharkhand primary schools with offline-capable Edge AI. Real-time classroom speech translation from Hindi/English into Santhali, Mundari, Ho, Kurukh, Kharia, and beyond.\",\n    hero_alt_names_label: \"Alternative Linguistic Names:\",\n    hero_btn_demo: \"Try Live Prototype\",\n    hero_btn_video: \"Watch Pitch Video\",\n    hero_stat_1_val: \"40%+\",\n    hero_stat_1_lbl: \"Tribal Children in Rural Jharkhand\",\n    hero_stat_2_val: \"100%\",\n    hero_stat_2_lbl: \"Offline On-Device Capable\",\n    hero_stat_3_val: \"8+\",\n    hero_stat_3_lbl: \"Indigenous Languages Supported\",\n\n    prob_tag: \"The Challenge\",\n    prob_title: \"The Silent Classroom Crisis in Rural India\",\n    prob_subtitle: \"When a teacher speaks only Hindi and the child speaks only Santhali or Ho, learning stops before it even begins.\",\n    prob_story_title: \"The Ground Reality in West Singhbhum & Dumka\",\n    prob_story_text: \"Freshly appointed primary teachers in Jharkhand's tribal heartlands often arrive without speaking the local mother tongue of their students. In Grade 1 classrooms, children listen to unfamiliar state curricula in silence, unable to comprehend foundational phonics or basic numeracy. NEP 2020 mandates primary education in the mother tongue, but severe teacher shortages and language mismatches leave millions behind.\",\n    prob_card1_num: \"38.4%\",\n    prob_card1_label: \"Foundational Literacy Gap\",\n    prob_card1_desc: \"Between native tribal-speaking students and state-language medium students by Grade 3.\",\n    prob_card2_num: \"8+\",\n    prob_card2_label: \"Indigenous Languages\",\n    prob_card2_desc: \"In Jharkhand without mainstream digitized digital primary school curriculum.\",\n    prob_card3_num: \"74%\",\n    prob_card3_label: \"Teacher Communication Barrier\",\n    prob_card3_desc: \"Primary rural teachers report language disconnect as their single biggest classroom impediment.\",\n    prob_card4_num: \"12,000+\",\n    prob_card4_label: \"Zero-Connectivity Schools\",\n    prob_card4_desc: \"Classrooms in deep forest blocks with zero cellular signal requiring 100% offline Edge AI.\",\n\n    sol_tag: \"The Innovation\",\n    sol_title: \"Empowering Rural Teachers With Edge AI Pedagogy\",\n    sol_subtitle: \"An inclusive, lightweight, offline-first pedagogical assistant designed for low-resource classroom hardware.\",\n    sol_card1_title: \"Real-Time Classroom Translation\",\n    sol_card1_desc: \"Bidirectional speech-to-speech and speech-to-text. Teachers speak natural Hindi or English; students hear clear native audio in their mother tongue.\",\n    sol_card2_title: \"100% Offline Edge-First AI\",\n    sol_card2_desc: \"Runs completely offline using 4-bit quantized IndicTrans2 and Whisper models stored directly in local device cache. Zero internet required.\",\n    sol_card3_title: \"Multimodal Visual Flashcards\",\n    sol_card3_desc: \"Converts spoken vocabulary into culturally relevant visual aids, pictograms, and dual-script flashcards to reinforce conceptual learning.\",\n    sol_card4_title: \"Low-Literacy Teacher Dashboard\",\n    sol_card4_desc: \"Minimalist, icon-driven interface designed for first-time smartphone users. Adapts JCERT textbook chapters into bilingual lessons with one tap.\",\n\n    demo_tag: \"Interactive Working Prototype\",\n    demo_title: \"Experience BhashaSetu In Action\",\n    demo_subtitle: \"Simulate a live rural classroom interaction. Select languages, load classroom scenarios, or speak into the microphone.\",\n    demo_mode_online: \"Cloud Neural API (High Precision)\",\n    demo_mode_offline: \"Offline Edge Model (Local Cache)\",\n    demo_mode_badge_online: \"☁️ Online Mode: IndicTrans2 Cloud Neural Pipeline • 850ms latency\",\n    demo_mode_badge_offline: \"⚡ Offline Mode: 4-bit Quantized On-Device TFLite Model • 0 kbps internet • 310ms latency\",\n    demo_src_lbl: \"Teacher's Language (Input):\",\n    demo_tgt_lbl: \"Student's Mother Tongue (Output):\",\n    demo_input_ph: \"Type teacher's instruction here, or click a classroom scenario preset below...\",\n    demo_btn_translate: \"Translate to Mother Tongue\",\n    demo_btn_translating: \"Processing AI Pedagogy Pipeline...\",\n    demo_preset_title: \"Or Click a Common Classroom Scenario:\",\n    demo_preset_1: \"Morning Greeting & Roll Call\",\n    demo_preset_2: \"Math Addition Lesson\",\n    demo_preset_3: \"Hygiene & Mid-Day Meal\",\n    demo_preset_4: \"Folk Story Introduction\",\n    demo_preset_5: \"Science & Nature Observation\",\n    demo_mic_tip: \"Click mic to speak in Hindi or English\",\n    demo_output_title: \"Student Pedagogy Output\",\n    demo_phonetic_title: \"Teacher's Pronunciation Guide (How to speak it):\",\n    demo_listen_btn: \"Play Audio\",\n    demo_copy_btn: \"Copy Text\",\n\n    how_tag: \"Architecture & Workflow\",\n    how_title: \"From Teacher's Voice to Student's Comprehension\",\n    how_subtitle: \"Engineered specifically for low-connectivity, noisy rural primary classrooms.\",\n    how_step1_title: \"1. Speech Capture & Noise Filtering\",\n    how_step1_desc: \"Teacher speaks into standard phone/tablet. On-device acoustic filters isolate classroom ambient noise.\",\n    how_step2_title: \"2. Intelligent Network Sensing\",\n    how_step2_desc: \"Dynamic switch selects local TFLite neural model when offline, or cloud IndicTrans2 cluster when cellular signal exists.\",\n    how_step3_title: \"3. Vernacular Pedagogical Engine\",\n    how_step3_desc: \"Translates syntax while preserving tribal grammatical nuances, honorifics, and local cultural idioms.\",\n    how_step4_title: \"4. Multimodal Classroom Delivery\",\n    how_step4_desc: \"Produces clear synthetic native speech, Romanized phonetic guide for the teacher, and visual pictograms for young students.\",\